#5800
oldric master teacher old~
Master Oldric~
Master Oldric, the last teacher of the Academy, stands at the lectern.
~
Oldric is a white-bearded old warrior with one eye, a wooden leg and a
voice that could still carry across a battlefield.  He has taught at the
Academy for longer than anyone can remember, and he has outlived every
other teacher it ever had.  He still wears his old sword at his hip, and
he still looks at every new face as if wondering how long it will last.
~
