a Kinthalas warrior~
A huge Kinthalas warrior swaggers past, a battleaxe over his shoulder.
~
He stands well over seven feet, with a bull's head, a mane of coarse
black hair and horns tipped with brass.  A red axe is branded on his
shoulder.  Like every Kinthalas warrior, he is waiting for his chance to
fight his way up the red stair, and he would be happy to practice on you
in the meantime.
~
