#5812
krommyon king minotaur kinthalas~
Krommyon, King of the Kinthalas~
Krommyon, King of the Kinthalas, lounges on his ancient throne, chewing a bone.
~
Krommyon is the largest minotaur you have ever seen, a mountain of
muscle and black fur nine feet tall, his horns capped with gold and his
snout pierced with a heavy iron ring.  He calls himself the king of the
Kinthalas, and none of his warriors has yet been brave enough, or
foolish enough, to argue.  The red axe across his knees is stained to
the haft.
~
