#5813
dhak mad minotaur~
Dhak the Mad~
Dhak the Mad paces in circles, singed and twitching, muttering to himself.
~
Dhak was once the Kinthalas' only battle-mage, until one of his
experiments went very badly wrong.  His fur is singed in patches, one
horn is blackened, and his eyes never stop moving.  Little sparks
crackle between his fingers when he mutters, and the walls of his
chamber show what happens when the sparks get away from him.
~
