She is tall and lean for a minotaur, with short gray fur and small, neat
horns, and a pair of spectacles perched on her broad nose.  A white axe
is embroidered on her robe.  The Byterians value learning above
everything, and she looks at you with polite interest, as if you might
turn out to be a footnote.
~
