Skeiron the Lorekeeper~
Skeiron the Lorekeeper sits at his huge desk, buried in books and star charts.
~
Skeiron is the eldest of the three who rule the Byterians, his fur gone
white and his horns worn smooth with age.  He has read every book in the
Great Library at least twice and written a good many of them, and he
speaks slowly, as though each word were being looked up in an index.
~
