Kerkyon the Axe-lord~
Kerkyon the Axe-lord stands among the paintings of his ancestors, a white axe in hand.
~
Kerkyon is the warrior of the three Byterian lords, as big as any
Kinthalas and twice as disciplined.  He wears gray plate trimmed with
silver, and the great axe he carries has a blade of white enameled
steel.  He believes that the Byterians must one day settle their quarrel
with the Kinthalas, and he intends to be ready.
~
