prokrustes measurer minotaur byterian~
Prokrustes~
Prokrustes studies you from his plain chair, a long iron rod across his knees.
~
Prokrustes is the third of the Byterian lords, and the strangest.  He
keeps his room bare and too brightly lit, and he cannot abide anything
that does not fit: a crooked picture, an uneven step, a guest of the
wrong size.  He carries an iron measuring rod everywhere, and when he
looks at you, you can see him measuring.
~
